   },
   "worked_solution": [
      {
         "step": 1,
         "text": "A thin slab of thickness dh holds about \\( 12.25\\,\\rho(h)\\,dh \\), so the total is \\( 12.25\\int_{1}^{7} \\left(10 \\sin{\\left(\\frac{h^{2}}{3} \\right)} + 60\\right)\\,dh \\).",
         "rule_named": "accumulation of a density"
      },
      {
         "step": 2,
         "text": "With the calculator in radian mode the integral is about 371.522.",
         "mathjson": 371.52216152710054,
         "rule_named": "numerical integration"
      },
      {
         "step": 3,
         "text": "Multiplying by the area 12.25 gives about 4551.146.",
